{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:04 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:04 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:04 2026-10-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"東海大樓發生縱火案。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/945644f69cec15f23203fc796e2a4b1d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_38_41_0.jpeg\"/><p>土瓜灣北帝街64-66號東海大樓 ，今（28日）早上11時37分，一名執達吏報案指上址一單位有火及冒煙，消防接報到場破門，出動一喉一煙帽隊救火，火警約17分鐘救熄。單位內一名50歲男住戶不適，清醒送院治理。警方經調查後，懷疑該名男住戶曾放火燒木門，以涉嫌縱火將他拘捕。據悉，事件與租務糾紛有關。</p><img alt=\"消防到場救熄火警。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/af5c2bab028b17022ced8c61387f8eda/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_38_42_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f51d82dad007148f295609cd7b6efe3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_38_42_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防接報到場。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4203c0c414831909865266b733997583/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_38_42.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"東海大樓發生縱火案。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/91ff9bee2f75b8f9d181b21c5daa353d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_38_41_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/54b20aaf6f8790db75a5980c5e23dccf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_38_41.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:01:13.572366+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:04:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:47.746684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:58:41.088378+00:00","content_hash":"aafdb33bad60a5d6932823f4321277265ad4da5bd7c7faf3c79d6a6df5be589a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}